WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.242
Graph driven development runtime answers a

2
00:00:02.242 --> 00:00:04.484
hard problem. Agents can ship code

3
00:00:04.484 --> 00:00:06.726
quickly. The harder part is keeping scope,

4
00:00:06.726 --> 00:00:08.968
dependencies, and completion under human

5
00:00:08.968 --> 00:00:11.210
control.

6
00:00:11.645 --> 00:00:13.922
g d d p runtime is the

7
00:00:13.922 --> 00:00:16.198
execution control plane for that contract.

8
00:00:16.198 --> 00:00:18.475
Project truth lives in a separate repo

9
00:00:18.475 --> 00:00:20.752
called g d d p config. Humans

10
00:00:20.752 --> 00:00:23.028
author nodes, dependencies, and acceptance

11
00:00:23.028 --> 00:00:25.305
criteria there.

12
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.460
This repository never silently rewrites

13
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.181
that truth. It reads the graph, observes

14
00:00:31.181 --> 00:00:33.901
attempts, stores evidence, and stops at

15
00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:36.622
review. Executors determine how. Operators

16
00:00:36.622 --> 00:00:39.342
still decide what is accepted.

17
00:00:39.777 --> 00:00:41.809
Think of the unit of intent as

18
00:00:41.809 --> 00:00:43.841
a node. A job, a session, a

19
00:00:43.841 --> 00:00:45.873
commit, a test run, and a verdict

20
00:00:45.873 --> 00:00:47.905
are all evidence about an attempt to

21
00:00:47.905 --> 00:00:49.937
satisfy that node. None of them completes

22
00:00:49.937 --> 00:00:51.969
the node automatically.

23
00:00:52.403 --> 00:00:54.801
The operating loop is a round trip.

24
00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:57.198
A ready node plus an explicit event

25
00:00:57.198 --> 00:00:59.596
becomes a bounded job. An adapter

26
00:00:59.596 --> 00:01:01.993
dispatches a neutral packet. Durable

27
00:01:01.993 --> 00:01:04.391
evidence returns. Evaluation writes a

28
00:01:04.391 --> 00:01:06.788
receipt. A human accepts, retries, blocks,

29
00:01:06.788 --> 00:01:09.186
or defers.

30
00:01:09.621 --> 00:01:12.291
Here is the system map. Operators author

31
00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:14.962
graphs in config. Intake accepts GitHub

32
00:01:14.962 --> 00:01:17.632
webhooks into SQLite events. The heartbeat

33
00:01:17.632 --> 00:01:20.303
claims work and plans dispatches. Adapters

34
00:01:20.303 --> 00:01:22.973
talk to Jules, Droid, local subprocess, or

35
00:01:22.973 --> 00:01:25.644
Factory mission.

36
00:01:26.078 --> 00:01:28.949
Runtime state lives in SQLite under

37
00:01:28.949 --> 00:01:31.821
events, jobs, sessions, and results. Graph

38
00:01:31.821 --> 00:01:34.692
YAML stays outside. That separation is

39
00:01:34.692 --> 00:01:37.564
load bearing. Machinery can fail and

40
00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:40.435
recover without inventing project truth.

41
00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:43.237
Every few minutes the heartbeat ticks.

42
00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:45.604
First it reconciles open executor sessions

43
00:01:45.604 --> 00:01:47.970
so asynchronous work can finish even when

44
00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:50.337
no new webhook arrives. Then it may

45
00:01:50.337 --> 00:01:52.704
advance the frontier one hop.

46
00:01:53.137 --> 00:01:55.545
After that it claims pending events,

47
00:01:55.545 --> 00:01:57.952
classifies only explicit node tags, scope

48
00:01:57.952 --> 00:02:00.360
checks for duplicates, and reserves job

49
00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.768
and session rows under a database lock.

50
00:02:02.768 --> 00:02:05.175
Dispatch can fan out, but recording stays

51
00:02:05.175 --> 00:02:07.583
serialized.

52
00:02:08.017 --> 00:02:10.422
Await review still counts as active. That

53
00:02:10.422 --> 00:02:12.826
prevents the same node from being launched

54
00:02:12.826 --> 00:02:15.231
twice while a human has not decided

55
00:02:15.231 --> 00:02:17.635
yet. Provisional dependents may proceed,

56
00:02:17.635 --> 00:02:20.040
but completion remains human owned.

57
00:02:20.475 --> 00:02:22.571
Executors are replaceable transports

58
00:02:22.571 --> 00:02:24.667
behind one packet contract. Local

59
00:02:24.667 --> 00:02:26.763
subprocess and Droid run one attempt per

60
00:02:26.763 --> 00:02:28.860
durable spool directory and return a

61
00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:30.956
commit reference. Jules still uses the

62
00:02:30.956 --> 00:02:33.052
older mediated issue and pull request

63
00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:35.148
path.

64
00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:37.642
Factory mission is the multi node path.

65
00:02:37.642 --> 00:02:39.701
Eligible ready nodes are projected into

66
00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:41.760
one engagement with a strict one to

67
00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.819
one feature mapping. Feature identity

68
00:02:43.819 --> 00:02:45.878
drift parks the engagement for review

69
00:02:45.878 --> 00:02:47.937
instead of pretending the graph still

70
00:02:47.937 --> 00:02:49.996
matches.

71
00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:52.575
Inside a mission, each feature should make

72
00:02:52.575 --> 00:02:54.719
one commit with a node trailer. Evidence

73
00:02:54.719 --> 00:02:56.864
is sliced per node after the process

74
00:02:56.864 --> 00:02:59.009
ends. Push guards and post hoc remote

75
00:02:59.009 --> 00:03:01.153
checks defend protected branches when

76
00:03:01.153 --> 00:03:03.298
hooks are bypassed.

77
00:03:03.734 --> 00:03:06.092
When work returns, evaluation pins a

78
00:03:06.092 --> 00:03:08.451
commit and materializes a worktree.

79
00:03:08.451 --> 00:03:10.809
Deterministic criteria build the floor:

80
00:03:10.809 --> 00:03:13.168
constraints, artifacts, dependencies, and

81
00:03:13.168 --> 00:03:15.526
probes. If criteria are still

82
00:03:15.526 --> 00:03:17.885
indeterminate, a semantic lane can

83
00:03:17.885 --> 00:03:20.243
adjudicate.

84
00:03:20.677 --> 00:03:22.980
Integrity always runs as a separate

85
00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.282
question. Did this attempt preserve

86
00:03:25.282 --> 00:03:27.584
project intent and structural health. The

87
00:03:27.584 --> 00:03:29.887
combiner takes the worse of criteria and

88
00:03:29.887 --> 00:03:32.189
integrity. A verdict receipt is evidence,

89
00:03:32.189 --> 00:03:34.492
never an accept action.

90
00:03:34.927 --> 00:03:36.985
A strong pass may mark the graph

91
00:03:36.985 --> 00:03:39.044
node provisional so dependents can

92
00:03:39.044 --> 00:03:41.102
dispatch. That is scheduler visibility.

93
00:03:41.102 --> 00:03:43.160
Complete still requires a human edit in

94
00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.218
g d d p config. Tests can

95
00:03:45.218 --> 00:03:47.277
fail on an accepted node without rewriting

96
00:03:47.277 --> 00:03:49.335
history.

97
00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:51.851
By the numbers this is a dense

98
00:03:51.851 --> 00:03:53.933
Python control plane. About thirty nine

99
00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:56.014
thousand lines of Python, over four

100
00:03:56.014 --> 00:03:58.095
hundred commits in recent months, and the

101
00:03:58.095 --> 00:04:00.176
hottest directories are the heartbeat and

102
00:04:00.176 --> 00:04:02.258
adapters. Roughly one in five commits

103
00:04:02.258 --> 00:04:04.339
carries bot co authorship as a lower

104
00:04:04.339 --> 00:04:06.420
bound.

105
00:04:06.854 --> 00:04:09.381
On production hosts the operator path is

106
00:04:09.381 --> 00:04:11.908
the mini heartbeat kit. Install dormant if

107
00:04:11.908 --> 00:04:14.435
needed, run smoke, then arm with an

108
00:04:14.435 --> 00:04:16.963
explicit flag. Do not invoke the raw

109
00:04:16.963 --> 00:04:19.490
runner without the environment that loads

110
00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:22.017
spool paths and executor argument vectors.

111
00:04:22.452 --> 00:04:24.612
Linux hosts need Kill Mode process on

112
00:04:24.612 --> 00:04:26.773
the oneshot timer so the tick cannot

113
00:04:26.773 --> 00:04:28.933
reap freshly spawned workers. Secrets

114
00:04:28.933 --> 00:04:31.094
resolve through commands, not committed

115
00:04:31.094 --> 00:04:33.254
files. Only one exclusive control plane

116
00:04:33.254 --> 00:04:35.415
should be armed unless split brain is

117
00:04:35.415 --> 00:04:37.575
intentional.

118
00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.614
Remember the contract as four short lines.

119
00:04:40.614 --> 00:04:43.217
Nodes are intent. Receipts are evidence.

120
00:04:43.217 --> 00:04:45.821
Evaluators advise. Humans decide. That is

121
00:04:45.821 --> 00:04:48.424
how g d d p keeps agent

122
00:04:48.424 --> 00:04:51.028
momentum without losing the graph.
